<br>
I am looking for a new place to call home. I have grown tired of the loot hungy guilds out there that have taken away from the fun that EQ holds. I want to get back to the fun that I know this game can be....  Going to new places.... Killing new mobs... EXP camping with friends....    I know Dynasty and Foreman IRL and would love to meet more of you.  Give me a shout if you want to get a group together and have some fun.<br>
<br>
Wedan Warsoul<br>
56th Monk <p><img src="http://eqbrell.homestead.com/files/wedannew.jpg" height=271 width=182></p><i></i></td></tr></table><table border=0 width=95%><tr><td align=left valign="top"> </td><td align=right valign="top"><br><br><a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=205.topic><img src=http://people.atl.mediaone.net/samugi/addreply.gif border=0 alt="Add Reply"></a> </td></tr></table><br><table width=95% border=0><td valign="top"> <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.emailToFriend?topicID=205.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/image/email.gif border=0 alt="Email This To a Friend"> Email This To a Friend</a><br> <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.threadControl?topicID=205.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/themes/sunset/deleteThread.gif border=0 alt="Topic Control Image"> Topic Commands (Moderator only)</a><br> <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.subscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=205.topic>Subscribe</a> Click to receive email notification of replies<br>  <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.unsubscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=205.topic>Unsubscribe</a> Click to stop receiving email notification of replies<br> </td><td align="right" valign="top"></td></tr><tr align="right"><td colspan=2><form action=http://pub24.ezboard.com/BBSForum.jumpShowForum method=post><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="1"><tr><td><b>jump to:</b><select name=forumName><option value="rellabyssfrm12">General Discussion<option value="rellabyssfrm10">New Members Sign-up<option value="rellabyssfrm2">Upcoming Raids<option value="rellabyssfrm8">General Discussion<option value="rellabyssfrm3">Lets do This<option value="rellabyssfrm4">Offerings and Christmas List<option value="rellabyssfrm5">New Member Sign Up & Discussion<option value="rellabyssfrm13">Epic Quest<option value="rellabyssfrm14">The Library<option value="rellabyssfrm15">Faction Table